cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Carolina Barbecue"
message: "If you use this data, please cite it."
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: "NaN"
    website: "https://nanobotco.github.io/carolina-barbecue/"
url: "https://nanobotco.github.io/carolina-barbecue/"
repository-code: "https://github.com/NaNoBotCo/carolina-barbecue"
license: CC-BY-4.0
date-released: "2026-09-23"
abstract: >-
  A directory of barbecue in North and South Carolina: styles, sauces, dishes, pit
  practice, places, people, organizations, events, vocabulary and art. One JSON
  record per node, every field carrying a provenance tier and citing a named source.
  Place points derive from OpenStreetMap under ODbL 1.0.
keywords:
  - barbecue
  - North Carolina
  - South Carolina
  - foodways
  - open data
